# Allowlist: send ONLY what the Dockerfile copies. Everything else (.env with API keys, certs/, data_processed/ with the
# restricted name list, models/, the raw dataset, eval results, .venv, git history) can never end up in the image.
*
!requirements.lock
!safemine
!app
!.streamlit
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc

# login secrets must never be baked into the image (compose mounts secrets.toml read-only at run time)
.streamlit/secrets.toml
.streamlit/INITIAL_ADMIN_PASSWORD.txt
.streamlit/secrets.toml.example
